#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:202
msgid ""
"This is testing area. You can test your trigger here to see if it does what "
"you want it to do. Simply type in some text and see what happens."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je testno područje. Možete testirati vaš okidač ovdje da biste vidjeli "
"da li radi ono što želite. Samo ukucajte neki tekst i vidite šta se dešava."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:236 kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:499
#: libs/caliaseditor.cpp:187 libs/caliaseditor.cpp:244
#: plugins/scripting/cscripteditor.cpp:86
msgid "&Options"
msgstr "&Opcije"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:239 libs/caliaseditor.cpp:196
msgid "Whole words only"
msgstr "Samo cijele riječi"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:240
msgid ""
"When enabled, this trigger will only match the text if there are spaces or "
"nothing before/after the matched string."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućen, ovaj okidač će se poklapati sa tekstom samo ako ima "
"znakova razmaka ili nema ničega prije/poslije označenog stringa."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:243 libs/caliaseditor.cpp:200
msgid "Case sensitive"
msgstr "Razlikuj mala i velika slova"

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:244 libs/caliaseditor.cpp:201
msgid ""
"When this option is on, upper case and lower case letters are treated as "
"different characters, otherwise they're considered to be the same."
msgstr ""
"Kada je ova opcija uključena, velika i mala slova se tretiraju kao različiti "
"karakteri, a inače se smatra da su isti."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:248
msgid "Show but do not send"
msgstr "Pokaži ali ne šalji."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:249
msgid ""
"When enabled, the text will not be sent to the MUD, it will only be "
"displayed on the screen."
msgstr ""
"Kada je omogućeno, tekst neće biti poslan MUD-u, samo će biti prikazan na "
"ekranu."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:252 libs/caliaseditor.cpp:209
msgid "Global matching"
msgstr "Globalno poklapanje."

#: kmuddy/ctriggereditor.cpp:253
msgid ""
"<p>With global matching, one trigger/trigger can match multiple times, if it "
"contains the pattern more than once. For example, if pattern is abc, it "
"matches only once on abcdabcd of global matching is off, but twice if it's "
"on. For each match, the requested actions are performed - so the commands "
"can be sent multiple times, once per match.</p><p>Note that failing the "
"condition does not terminate scanning, so you can use this to highlight "
"names from a list (using the condition to check if a match is in the list), "
"or something like that."
msgstr ""
"<p>Sa globalnim poklapanjem, jedan okidač/okidač može poklapati više puta, "
"ako sadrži uzorak više nego jednom. Naprimjer, ako je uzorak abc, poklapa se "
"samo jednom sa abcdabcd ako je globalno poklapanje isključeno, a dva puta "
"ukoliko je uključeno. Za svako poklapanje, zatražene akcije su izvršene - "
"tako da komande mogu biti poslane više puta, po jednom po poklapanju.</"
"p><p>Primjetite da neuspjeh uslova ne okončava skeniranje, tako da možete "
"koristiti ovo da označite imena sa liste (koristeći uslov da provjerite da "
"li ima poklapanja u listi), ili nesšto tog tipa."

