#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:95
msgid "S&how the tab bar even if not needed"
msgstr "P&rikaži traku kartica čak iako nije potrebna"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:96
msgid ""
"If this is checked, the tab bar will always be shown. Otherwise, it will be "
"hidden if it contains only one tab."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovo označeno, traka kartica će uvijek biti prikazana. U durgom "
"slučaju, bit će skrivena ukoliko sadrži samo jednu karticu."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:99
msgid "Show au&xiliary input line"
msgstr "Prikaži po&moćnu liniju unosa"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:100
msgid "You will have two input lines instead of one."
msgstr "Imat ćete dvije linije unosa umjesto jedne."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:102
msgid "&Always notify"
msgstr "&Uvijek obavijesti"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:103
msgid ""
"If this is checked, output notification will be used whenever some text "
"comes from the server. Otherwise, it will only be used when a notification "
"trigger is activated. Note that this option only takes effect if global or "
"local notification is enabled."
msgstr ""
"Ako je ovo označeno, izlazna obavijest će biti korištena kada god neki tekst "
"dođe od servera. U drugom slučaju, bit će korištena samo onda kada je okidač "
"za obavijesti aktiviran. Primjetite da ova opcija ima efekta samo ako je "
"globalna ili lokalna obavijest uključena."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:108
msgid "&Global notification"
msgstr "&Globalne notifikacije"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:109
msgid ""
"When some text comes from the server and KMuddy is not currently active, "
"window caption and the taskbar will try to attract your attention (some "
"characters will blink there)."
msgstr ""
"Kada neki tekst dođe od servera i KMuddy nije trenutno aktivan, natpis u "
"prozoru i alatna traka će pokušati da privuku vašu pažnju (neka slova će da "
"svjetlucaju povremeno)."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:113
msgid "&Local notification"
msgstr "&Lokalna obavijest"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:114
msgid ""
"When some text comes from the server and this session is not currently "
"active, its tab will try to attract your attention (some characters will "
"blink there)."
msgstr ""
"Kada neki tekst dođe od servera i ova sesija nije trenutno aktivna, njena "
"sesija će pokušati da privče vašu pažnju (neka slova će da svjetlucaju "
"povremeno)."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:119
msgid "Display system tray icon"
msgstr "Prikaži ikonu pored sata"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:120
msgid ""
"This option toggles the presence of the system tray icon. The icon can be "
"used to hide the application window without taking up space in the taskbar. "
"You can click on the icon to hide the window and then click again to restore "
"it. Your connection will remain active even if the window is hidden and you "
"will still receive notification messages. "
msgstr ""

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:128
msgid "Use passive popups"
msgstr "Koristi pasivne iskačuće prozore."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:129
msgid ""
"This option toggles the use of passive popups. Passive popups appear near "
"the system tray icon when you are in another window and alert you to the "
"presence of activity in one of your connections. "
msgstr ""

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:135
msgid "Auto-connect on startup"
msgstr "Automatski se konektuj na startu sistema."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:136
msgid ""
"With this option set, the selected connection will be automatically "
"initiated immediately after starting KMuddy. Handy when you connect using "
"one profile most of the time."
msgstr ""
"Kada je ova opcija aktivirana, odabrana konekcija će automatski  biti "
"pokrenuta odmah nakon pokretanja KMuddy-a. Korisno kada se konektujete "
"koristeći jedan profil većinu vremena."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:139
msgid "Auto-connect to:"
msgstr "Automatski se konektuj na;"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:176
msgid "Default &background color"
msgstr "Podrazumijevana &boja pozadine"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:179
msgid "This color will be used as a standard background color."
msgstr "Ova boja će biti korištena kao standardna boja pozadine."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:181
msgid "Default &text color"
msgstr "Podrazumijevana &boja teksta"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:184
msgid "This color will be used to display standard text with no defined color."
msgstr ""
"Ova boja će biti korištena da se prikaže standardni tekst bez specificirane "
"boje."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:186
msgid "Command &echo color"
msgstr "Boja &echo komande"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:189
msgid "This color will be used to display commands that you have entered."
msgstr "Ovaj boja će biti korištena da se prikažu komande koje ste unijeli."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:191
msgid "&System message color"
msgstr "&Boja sistemskih poruka"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:194
msgid "This color will be used for various system messages."
msgstr "Ova boja će biti korištena za različite sistemske poruke."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:215
msgid "Enable co&mmand echo"
msgstr "Uključi ko&mandu echo"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:216
msgid ""
"Enables displaying of commands in the console.<p><b>Please note:</b> This "
"will also disable command echo in session transcript."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje prikazivanje komandi u konzoli.<p><b>Molimo primjetite:</b> Ovo će "
"također isključiti echo komandu u transkriptu sesije."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:219
msgid "Enable s&ystem messages"
msgstr "Uključi s&istemske poruke"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:220
msgid "Enables displaying of system messages in the console."
msgstr "Uključuje prikazivanje sistemskih poruka u konzoli."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:224
msgid "Enable b&linking"
msgstr "Uključi  s&vjetlucanje"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:225
msgid ""
"Enables support for blinking. This is disabled by default, because most "
"players don't like it."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje podršku za svjetlucanje. Ovo je podrazumijevano isključeno, jer "
"većina igrača to ne voli."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:229
msgid "Enable &word wrapping"
msgstr "Omogući &prelom teksta."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:230
msgid ""
"If a line that is longer than current console width is to be displayed, it "
"wraps to the next line. With this option enabled, whole words will move to "
"the next line, instead of cutting words in the middle."
msgstr ""
"Ako linija koja je duža od trenutne širine konzole treba biti prikazana, "
"prelama se u sjledeću liniju. Uz ovu opciju uključenu, cijele riječi će se "
"pomjeriti u sljedeći red, umjesto prekida riječi u pola."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:237
msgid "&Indentation"
msgstr "&Uvlačenje"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:241
msgid "None"
msgstr "Nijedan"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:244
msgid ""
"When a line is too long, part of it will be moved to the next line. "
"Indentation says how many spaces will be put to the beginning of the "
"continued line."
msgstr ""
"Kada je linija preduga, dio nje će biti premješten u sljedecći red. "
"Indentacija određuje koliko znakova razmaka će biti stavljeno na početak "
"sljedećeg reda."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:250
msgid "W&rap at position"
msgstr "P&relomi na poziciji"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:254
msgid "As needed"
msgstr "Kako je potrebno"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:257
msgid ""
"Wrap at a fixed position, or at the rightmost position, if no value is given."
msgstr ""
"Prelomi na fiksiranoj poziciji, ili na poziciji koja je prva sa desna, "
"ukoliko nije data vrijednost."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:262
msgid "&History buffer size"
msgstr "&Velicina bafera historije"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:266 kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:279
msgid "lines"
msgstr "linije"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:269
msgid ""
"Size of output scroll-back buffer. Please note that this setting will only "
"affect new connections, existing ones will keep their history setting."
msgstr ""
"Veličina izlaznog bafera sa mogućnošću pregleda prijašnjih unosa. Molimo "
"primijetite da će ovo podešavanje imati efekta samo na nove konekcije, već "
"postojeće će zadržati prijašnja podešavanja."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:275
msgid "&Forced redraw after"
msgstr "&Forsirani prepis nakon"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:280
#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgprofilesettings.cpp:224
msgid "Never"
msgstr "Nikad"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:283
msgid ""
"Forced redraw after adding a given amount of lines. Setting this to a low "
"number may prevent some displaying problems, at a cost of higher CPU usage. "
"Setting it to Never will disable the feature, redraw will only occur when "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Forsirani prepis nakon dodavanja date količine linija. Podešavanje ovoga na "
"mali broj može spriječiti neke probleme prikazivanja, po cijenu veće "
"korištenja CPU. Podešavanje ovoga na Nikad će isključiti ovu opciju, prepis "
"će se desiti samo kada je potreban."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:297
msgid "&Server output"
msgstr "&Serverski izlaz"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:300 kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:310
#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:320
msgid "Choose..."
msgstr "Izaberi..."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:303
msgid "Here you can select a font that will be used for main display."
msgstr "Ovdje možete odabrati font koji će biti korišten za glavni displej."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:307
msgid "&Input line"
msgstr "&Linija unosa"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:313
msgid "Here you can select a font that will be used for the input line."
msgstr "Ovdje možete odabrati font koji će biti korišten za liniju unosa."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:317
msgid "&Multi-line input"
msgstr "&Višelinijski unos"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:323
msgid ""
"Here you can select a font that will be used for the multi-line input window."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete odabrati font koji će biti korišten u prozoru za višelinijski "
"unos."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:342
msgid "&Keep sent text"
msgstr "&Sačuvaj poslani tekst"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:343
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, commands will remain in the input line after you "
"send them (by pressing ENTER); otherwise it will be cleared."
msgstr ""
"Ako uključite ovu opciju, komande će ostati u liniji za unos nakon što ih "
"pošaljete (pritiskom tipke ENTER); u drugom slučaju će biti počišćene."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:346
msgid "&Select kept text after it's sent"
msgstr "&Označi zadržani tekst nakon što je poslan"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:347
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, entered command will be selected. This allows you "
"to immediately type another command without deleting the old one and still "
"be able to reuse previous command easily."
msgstr ""
"Ako uključite ovu opciju, unesena komanda će biti označena. Ovo vam "
"omogućava da odmah unesete drugu komandu bez brisanja stare, a da i dalje "
"možete vrlo lahko ponovo iskoristiti prijašnju komandu."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:352
msgid "&Cursor keys browse history"
msgstr "&Kursor tipke za pretragu historije"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:353
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, you will be able to choose previously entered "
"commands with Up and Down keys."
msgstr ""
"Ako uključite ovu opciju, bit ćete u mogućnosti da birate prethodno unesene "
"komande sa Gore i Dolje tipkama."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:355
msgid "Telnet-style &paste"
msgstr "Telnet-stil &za lijepljenje"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:356
msgid ""
"Enables telnet-style pasting, i.e. if multi-line text is pasted, all lines "
"but the last are sent as commands immediately."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje telnet-stil lijepljenja, npr. ako je višelinijski tekst "
"zalijepljen, sve linije osim posljednje su poslane kao komande odmah."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:359
msgid "T&rim spaces"
msgstr "O&dstranjivanje znakova razmaka"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:360
msgid ""
"Enables trimming of spaces from commands. Note that with this option "
"disabled, you should avoid including spaces when typing multiple commands on "
"one line, or you will encounter problems with special sequences not being "
"detected properly."
msgstr ""
"Uključuje odstranjivanje znakova razmaka od komandi. Primijetite da sa ovom "
"opcijom isključenom, trebali biste izbjegavati ukucanjavanje razmaka "
"prilikom unosa više komandi u liniju, ili ćete naići na probleme sa "
"nepravilnom detekcijom specijalnih sekvenci."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:365
msgid "Enable &auto-completion"
msgstr "Uključi &automatsko dopunjavanje"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:366
msgid ""
"Auto-completion is a feature that offers you possible completions for "
"commands, as you type them. It can also finish the command for you."
msgstr ""
"Automatsko dopunjavanje je opcija koja vam nudi moguće završetke za komande, "
"dok ih pišete. Može također završiti unos komande za vas."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:374
msgid "T&ype of auto-completion"
msgstr "T&ip automatskog dopunjavanja."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:376
msgid "Auto-fill"
msgstr "Automatsko popunjavanje"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:377
msgid "Shortest-match auto-fill"
msgstr "Automatsko dopunjavanje za najkraće poklapanje"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:378
msgid "Popup list-box"
msgstr "Iskačuća lista kutija"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:382
msgid "&Background color"
msgstr "&Pozadinska boja"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:385
msgid "Background color of the input line"
msgstr "Pozadinska boja linije unosa"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:387
msgid "&Text color"
msgstr "&Boja teksta"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:390
msgid "Color of text that you type in the input line."
msgstr "Boja teksta kojeg unosite u liniju unosa."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:406
msgid "S&wap ENTER and CTRL+ENTER for multi-line"
msgstr "Z&amijeni ENTER i CTRL+ENTER za višelinijski"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:407
msgid ""
"When turned off, CTRL+ENTER will insert another line in the multi-line input "
"line, and ENTER will send commands to the server. If turned on, then the "
"behaviour of these keys gets swapped."
msgstr ""
"Kada je isključeno, CTRL+ENTER će unijeti još jednu liniju u višelinijsku "
"liniju za unos, a ENTER će će slati komande serveru. Ako je uključeno, "
"ponašanje ovih tipki se zamijeni."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:425
msgid "Dark colors"
msgstr "Tamne boje"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:426
msgid "Bright colors"
msgstr "Svijetle boje"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:453
msgid "&Command separator string"
msgstr "&String za razdvajanje komande"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:456
msgid ""
"You can enter multiple commands at once, they will get executed together. "
"Here you can enter string that can be used to separate individual commands."
msgstr ""
"Mozete unijeti više komandi odjednom, bit će izvšene zajedno. Ovdje možete "
"unijeti string koji može biti korišten za razdvajanje individualnih komandi."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:460
msgid "&Speed-walk string"
msgstr "&String za brzi hod"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:463
msgid ""
"If you start a command with this string, the command will be interpreted as "
"speed-walking. Every character is treated as one command: n, s, w, e, j"
"(=ne), k(=se), l(=sw), m(=nw), u, d.<p>Commands that will be sent for each "
"direction can be set up in <i>MUD preferences</i> (<b>profile-based</b> "
"connections only)."
msgstr ""
"Ako počnete komandu sa ovim stringom, komanda će biti interpretirana kao "
"komanda sa brzim hodom. Svaki karakter će biti tretiran kao jedna komanda: "
"n, s, w, e, j(=ne), k(=se), l(=sw), m(=nw), u, d.<p>Komande koje će biti "
"poslane za svaku direktivu mogu biti podešene u <i>MUD preference</i> "
"(<b>samo profilno-zasnovane</b>konekcije)."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:469
msgid "S&peed-walk even if empty"
msgstr "B&rzi hod čak ako je prazno"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:470
msgid ""
"Enabling this will cause KMuddy to expand speed-walk strings even if no "
"speed-walk string has been given. This allows faster speed-walking, but keep "
"in mind that EVERY command that consists only of valid speed-walk characters "
"(news, for example) will be treated as speed-walking. To avoid this, you'll "
"have to type at least one character in upper-case."
msgstr ""
"Uključivanje ovoga će imati učinak da Kmuddy proširuje stringove sa brzim "
"hodom čak i ako string za brzi hod nije dat. Ovo omogućava brži brzi hod, "
"ali upamtite da SVAKA komanda koja se sastoji samo od validnih karaktera za "
"brzi hod (news, na primjer) će biti tretirana kao brzi hod. Da biste "
"izbjegli ovo, morat ćete kucati makar jedan karakter velikim slovom."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:477
msgid "Macro-ca&ll string"
msgstr "Makro-p&oziv stringa"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:480
msgid ""
"If you start a command with this string, the command will be interpreted as "
"a macro-call.<br>Syntax is &lt;this string&gt; &lt;command&gt; [parameters]  "
"(/exec calls external scripts)"
msgstr ""
"Ako počnete komandu sa ovim stringom, komanda će biti tretirana kao makro-"
"poziv.<br>Sintaksa je &lt;this string&gt;komanda&gt;[parametri](/exec poziva "
"vanjske stringove)"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:485
msgid "&Repeater string"
msgstr "&String za ponavljanje"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:488
msgid ""
"Allows you to repeat some command. For example, typing <i>#10 say hello</i> "
"sends that command 10 times. <br>Note that this also works with aliases and "
"macro execution.<br>Repeater and number may be separated by a space (spaces)."
msgstr ""
"Omogućava vam da ponavljate neke komande. Naprimjer, ukucavanje <i>#10 reci "
"zdravo </i> šalje tu komandu 10  puta. <br>Primjetite da ovo također radi sa "
"aliasima i makro egzegucijama.<br>Ponavljač i broj mogu biti odvojeni "
"razmakom(ili razmacima)."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:494
msgid "&Focus string"
msgstr "&Fokus string"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:497
msgid ""
"If a command is started with this string, the command will be interpreted as "
"a command-focus-call. This will allow you to send commands to other "
"connected characters.<br>Syntax is &lt;this string&gt; &lt;focus tab&gt; &lt;"
"this string&gt; &lt;command&gt;"
msgstr ""
"Ako je komanda započeta sa ovim stringom, komanda će biti interpretirana kao "
"komanda sa fokus pozivom. Ovo će vam omogućiti da šaljete komande drugim "
"povezanim karakterima.<br>Sintaksa je &lt;ovaj string&gt; &lt;fokus tab&gt; "
"&lt;ovaj string&gt; &lt;komanda&gt;"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:503
msgid "Send &as-is"
msgstr "Pošalji &kako jeste"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:506
msgid ""
"If a command is started with this string, it will be sent as-is, without any "
"parsing. This string will be removed first."
msgstr ""
"Ako je komanda započeta sa ovim stringom, bit će poslata onakva kakva jeste, "
"bez ikakvog analiziranja. Ovaj string će biti otklonjen prvi."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:510
msgid "&Expand backslashes"
msgstr "&Proširi kose crte"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:511
msgid ""
"This will enable backslash expansion, that is: \\n is end-of-line, \\t is "
"TAB, \\\\ is \\, \\<anything else> means <anything else>."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će uključiti ekspanziju kosih crta, što je: \\n je kraj reda, \\t je "
"TAB, \\\\ je \\, \\<anything else> znači <anything else>."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:535
msgid "&Enable sounds globally"
msgstr "&Uključi zvukove općenito"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:536
msgid ""
"<qt>Enable playing sounds for all connections.\n"
"Note that you can override this setting in MUD Preferences dialog.\n"
"Also note that this will only work if your MUD supports <b>MSP</b> (MUD "
"Sound Protocol).</qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt>Uključi puštanje zvuka za sve konekcije.\n"
"Primjetite da možete prepraviti ovu opciju u MUD Preference dijalogu.\n"
"Također primjetite da će ovo jedino raditi ako vaš MUD podržava <b>MSP</b> "
"(MUD protokol zvuka).</qt>"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:540
msgid "Allow &downloading sounds"
msgstr "Dozvoli &preuzimanje zvukova"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgappsettings.cpp:542
msgid ""
"MSP version 0.3 supports downloading of sound files directly from the web or "
"FTP. You can enable this functionality here. Note that every sound will only "
"be downloaded once. The downloaded files are stored in your homedir in "
"directory\n"
msgstr ""
"MSP verzija 0.3 podržava preuzimanje zvučnih fajlova direktno sa web-a ili "
"FTP-a. Možete uključiti ovu funkciju ovdje. Primjetite da će svaki zvuk biti "
"preuzet jednom. Preuzeti fajlovi će biti sačuvani u vašem home folderu u "
"direktoriju\n"

