msgstr "Zatvara ovu dijalošku kutiju bez konektovanja."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgconnect.cpp:220
msgid ""
"This profile cannot be deleted, because you have a connection open using "
"this profile."
msgstr ""
"Ovaj profil ne može biti obrisan, jer imate otvorenu konekciju koja koristi "
"ovaj profil."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgconnect.cpp:220
