"riješiti probleme sa nekim serverima koji ne razumiju ove."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgprofilesettings.cpp:81
msgid "&Encoding:"
msgstr "&Kodiranje:"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgprofilesettings.cpp:84
msgid ""
"Lets you pick the output character encoding used by the server. This usually "
"only needs to be set for non-English servers."
msgstr ""
"Dopušta vam da odaberete kodiranje izlaznog karaktera korištenog od strane "
"servera. Ovo je obično samo potrebno podesiti za ne engleske servere."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgprofilesettings.cpp:90
msgid "&Auto-append newlines after prompt"
msgstr "&Automatski dodaji nove linije na kraj nakon prompta"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgprofilesettings.cpp:91
msgid ""
"Enables adding linefeeds after GA-terminated prompts to have properly "
"aligned output."
msgstr ""
"Omogućava dodavanje pomjerača u novi red nakon GA-terminiranih promptova da "
