msgstr "&Omogući osnovni transkript"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:56
msgid ""
"Enables or disabled the session transcript. Note that session transcript is "
"automatically disabled when you disconnect."
msgstr ""
"Omogućava ili onemogućava transkript sesije. Primjetite da je transkript "
"sesije automatski onemogućen kada se diskonektujete."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:60
msgid "Transcript settings"
msgstr "Podešavanja transkripta."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:66 kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:121
msgid "Transcript &format"
msgstr "&Format transkripta"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:75
msgid "&Overwrite existing file"
msgstr "&Prepiši postojeći fajl"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:76
msgid ""
"If you enable this option, existing transcript file will be overwritten. "
"Otherwise, new transcript will be appended to the end of an existing file "
"(if it exists :))."
msgstr ""
"Ako omogućite ovu opciju, postojeći transkript fajl će biti prepisan. U "
"drugom slučaju, novi transkript će biti dodan na kraj postojećeg fajla (ako "
"postoji :))"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:79
msgid "Include buffer &dump"
msgstr "Uključi &izdvojke bafera"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:80
msgid ""
"This will cause KMuddy to add complete buffer dump to the beginning of the "
"transcript file."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će prouzrokovati da KMuddy doda kompletan otpad bafera na početak "
"transkript fajla."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:109
msgid "Enable &advanced transcript"
msgstr "Omogući &napredni transkript"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:110
msgid ""
"This will enable advanced transcript, which allows you to have transcript "
"running all the time, rotates it at midnight and so. Note that normal and "
"advanced transcripts can both be running at the same time, if you want."
msgstr ""
"Ovo će omogućiti napredni transkript, što vam dozvoljava da je transkript "
"uključen svoj vrijeme, rotira se ako je ponoć i slično. Primjetite da i "
"normalni i napredni transkript mogu biti uključeni u isto vrijeme, ako "
"želite."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:115
msgid "Advanced transcript settings"
msgstr "Napredna podešavanja transkripta"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:130
msgid "&Rotate log at midnight every day"
msgstr "&Rotiraj zapis do sada spašenog u ponoć svakog dana"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:131
msgid ""
"This will cause KMuddy to rotate session transcript every day at midnight"
msgstr ""
"Ovo će prouzrokovati da KMuddy rotira transkript sesije svaki dan u ponoć"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:134
msgid "Prepend lines with &timestamp"
msgstr "Dodaj na početak linije sa &vremenskim pečatom"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:135
msgid ""
"This option will cause KMuddy to insert local timestamp in front of every "
"line of logging"
msgstr ""
"Ova opcija će prouzrokovati da KMuddy dodaje lokalne vremenske pečate na "
"početak zapisa spašavanja."

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:141
msgid "Log name format"
msgstr "Format imena zapisa spašavanja"

#: kmuddy/dialogs/dlgtranscript.cpp:142
msgid ""
"Here you can specify log format. You can use the following options: $W - "
"world name, $h - hour, $m - minute, $D - day, $M - month, $Y - year, and any "
"combination of alpha-numeric characters."
msgstr ""
"Ovdje možete specificirati format zapisa spašavanja. Možete koristiti "
"sljedeće opcije: $W - ime svijeta, $h - sat, $m - minut, $D - dan, $M - "
"mjesec, $Y - godina, i bilo koju kombinaciju alfanumeričkih karaktera."

